  "2026-10-14T11:23:20.025Z",codex-agent,"Plan: add the independently authored scheduled thin caller pinned to the audited workflow SHA and matching published extension version. Preserve dependencies, merge-driver scripts, and thresholds. Verify npm and Bun release gates and audits; leave the item open for orchestrator review. No TypeScript functions change, so a function revert regression test does not apply."
  "2026-10-14T11:23:48.561Z",codex-agent,"Before audit: all dependencies 0 vulnerabilities; production 0. No direct fast-glob or jscpd4 devDependency, so dependency manifests stay unchanged. Schedule: 17 4 * * * UTC. Skipped: actionlint is not installed and offline npm fallback is uncached."
  "2026-10-14T11:35:55.725Z",codex-agent,"Initial npm release gate: 598 of 599 tests passed, one worker-start timeout in test/generator-redos.test.ts. The summary-format worker did not start within its existing 5000 ms deadline while independent package gates overlapped. No runtime or test source changed. Preserve the timeout and coverage thresholds, check the existing test in isolation, then retry the full gate with reduced overlap."
  "2026-10-14T11:37:39.559Z",codex-agent,The isolated summary-format test passed 1/1 with zero skips and unchanged budgets. Reused and enriched the existing open test-stability issue pmc-redos-startup-231 instead of creating a duplicate; the full gate retry will run after other package validation finishes.
  "2026-10-14T12:48:55.012Z",codex-agent,"Retry scheduling update: only one other package gate remains active, and the isolated startup probe passed with unchanged budgets while checks overlapped. Retry the complete npm and Bun release checks with at most two package gates active, reduced from the initial three overlapping runs. Preserve every startup, CPU, hang, coverage, and dataset threshold."
  "2026-10-14T12:59:19.827Z",codex-agent,"Second full npm attempt: 598/599 tests passed; extract-release missed the existing 5000 ms worker-start deadline. This is the same startup class as the initial summary-format failure, with a different worker. Bun release validation remains required and is running. After the other package gate finishes, make one final npm attempt without package-gate overlap, preserving all budgets and thresholds; retain pmc-redos-startup-231 as the open stability follow-up."
  "2026-10-14T13:05:34.911Z",codex-agent,"Bun release:check passed all 599 tests with zero failures and zero skips at unchanged thresholds and worker budgets. npm remains unresolved after two separate 598/599 startup-deadline outcomes. Wait for the remaining package gate, then run one final complete npm check with no package-gate overlap; keep the known startup issue open and do not weaken the harness."
  "2026-10-14T13:11:06.803Z",codex-agent,"All other package gates have finished. Run the final complete npm release check without package-gate overlap, after regenerating and checking the changelog. The prior Bun gate passed 599/599 tests. Preserve all source code, worker deadlines, CPU and hang budgets, coverage thresholds, and the full acceptance corpus."
  "2026-10-14T13:29:57.034Z",codex-agent,"Verification: npm release:check status passed (tests 599; pass 599; fail 0; skipped 0); Bun release:check status passed (tests 599; pass 599; fail 0; skipped 0). Both use a scratch HOME, cleared PM_PATH and PM_AUTHOR, and disabled global/system Git configuration at unchanged thresholds. After audit: all 0, production 0. npm ls braces empty: True. Skipped: actionlint is not installed and offline npm fallback is uncached. No workflow dispatch, merge, release, or bot requests. Behavioural function revert proof is inapplicable to this caller-only change."
